# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare Worker static assets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Wrangler walks `assets.directory = "."`, i.e. the whole repo. On this checkout
# that is ~1.38M files and `wrangler deploy` died with:
#   FATAL ERROR: Reached heap limit Allocation failed (4 GB)
# after reading 1,381,962 files. The two dominant contributors are:
#   .git/      631,596 files   (VCS internals - must never be published)
#   scratch/    13,811 files   (throwaway work)
# The old file already listed `.git/`, but wrangler's matcher did not honour it
# here, so VCS internals were still walked. Keep entries forward-slash and
# directory-terminated.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# VCS + tooling state
.git/
.github/
.wrangler/
node_modules/

# Throwaway / working directories
scratch/
tmp/
tmp_pages_deploy/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local databases and dumps (too large; regenerated from sources)
supabase/
data/sqlite/
data/supabase/
*.sql
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Python tooling that is not served
scripts/
*.py

# Mapping artifacts: ~38 MB of per-collection link files, regenerated by the
# mapping scripts. The published summary the site reads is
# data/mapping-stats.json, which is NOT matched here.
*_links.json
mapping_*.json
*_full.json
fawaz_number_map.json
fawaz_verified_joins.json
nawawi_links_raw.json

# Process / temporary output: logs, probes, ad-hoc query dumps
*.log
_*.py
ch_out.json
query_out.json
naw_d1.json
conversation_history.jsonl
data_scan.log
cf_deploy.log
cf_pages.log
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.tmp
~$*
*.docx

# Source archives that are not served
data/raw_baseline/
data/backup/
data/exports/
data/datasets/

# Raw upstream source trees. These are INPUT, never fetched by a browser.
# data/sources/fawaz_api/editions alone is 652,520 files (222 editions each
# exploded per-hadith). Walking it is what exhausted the deploy heap.
# The served output lives in data/hadiths/, data/commentaries/, data/api/.
data/sources/

# Project-internal docs, not site pages
SCHEME_DISPLAY.md
